  "details": "The GNU Debugger (GDB) allows debugging programs written in C, C++, Java, and  \nother languages by executing them in a controlled fashion and then printing  \ntheir data.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gdb: STABS debug format parser out-of-bounds write via crafted ELF binary (CVE-2026-13732)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS  \nscore, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE  \npage(s) listed in the References section.\n",
